      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Utility theory is an AI technique that evaluates which action to perform
        based on a curve value. Behavior Designer Pro brings utility theory to behavior
        trees with the Utility Selector task.\n\nThe Utility Selector task will evaluate
        the curves every tick to determine which action should be performed based
        on the highest utility value. \n\nSee this page for more information:\nhttps://opsive.com/support/documentation/behavior-designer-pro/concepts/tasks/composite/utility-selector\n"
